        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/scene_mamushi.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 2debbe58-179d-43d1-abd4-5c8430caa8c0).Image",
        "Description": "`Harvest Protocol`\r\rWe have discovered information that the location the victims are taken to is a secluded mountain hospital, which has become a sanctuary for the Orpheus League’s most valuable clients. Here, victims transported from Miami and Haven have their organs harvested and fugitives receive identity-altering procedures and experimental enhancements in exchange for loyalty and silence.\r\rPenetrate the facility, identify the Moirai Division members, and surgically remove the chief specialist and his minions running the operation.",
